content.text:
Now the thread-inner max-width, and the PAGE_LAYER_LIST rule.

thread-inner: `.codex-thread-inner { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }` → `var(--cx-thread-max, 760px)`.

PAGE_LAYER_LIST rule: I'll add it near the box-model rule (after it), or right after the token blocks. Let me put it right after the "自绘 UI 统一盒模型" rule which is a good structural spot.

Current:
```
    /* ---------- 自绘 UI 统一盒模型 ---------- */
    .codex-rail, .codex-rail *,
    .codex-main, .codex-main * { box-sizing: border-box; }
```
Add after that:
```
    /* ---------- 页面层不透明度（设置面板 → 外观 → 页面不透明度） ----------
       选择器列表由 JS 常量 PAGE_LAYER_SELECTOR 展开（见 buildCss），
       所以「哪些算一层」只在 JS 里写一遍。浮层不在名单里，永远 100%。 */
    PAGE_LAYER_LIST {
      opacity: var(--cx-page-opacity, 1);
    }
```

Careful about the regex: `/PAGE_LAYER_LIST\s*\{/` matches the rule. The comment above must not contain "PAGE_LAYER_LIST" followed by optional whitespace and `{`. My comment says "选择器列表由 JS 常量 PAGE_LAYER_SELECTOR 展开" — safe.

Let me make both edits.

