```js
  /* ============================== 三栏拖拽调宽 ============================== */

  /** 绑定 [data-resize] 把手：pointer 拖拽实时写 CSS 变量，松手落到设置里 */
  function bindResizers() {
    document.querySelectorAll("[data-resize]").forEach((rz) => {
      if (rz.dataset.resizerBound === "1") return;
      rz.dataset.resizerBound = "1";
      rz.addEventListener("pointerdown", (e) => {
        e.preventDefault();
        const rootEl = document.documentElement;
        const cs = getComputedStyle(rootEl);
        const kind = rz.dataset.resize;
        const startX = e.clientX;
        const railW = parseFloat(cs.getPropertyValue("--cx-rail-w")) || RAIL_WIDTH;
        const startW = kind === "rail"
          ? railW
          : (document.querySelector(".cx-code-panel")?.getBoundingClientRect().width || 500);
        rz.classList.add("cx-dragging");
        document.body.classList.add("codex-resizing");
        const move = (ev) => {
          const dx = ev.clientX - startX;
          if (kind === "rail") {
            const w = Math.round(Math.min(Math.max(startW + dx, 240), Math.min(520, window.innerWidth * 0.34)));
            rootEl.style.setProperty("--cx-rail-w", w + "px");
          } else {
            const maxP = Math.max(320, window.innerWidth - railW - 420); // 中间栏至少留 420px
            const w = Math.round(Math.min(Math.max(startW - dx, 280), maxP));
            rootEl.style.setProperty("--cx-panel-w", w + "px");
          }
        };
        const up = () => {
          rz.classList.remove("cx-dragging");
          document.body.classList.remove("codex-resizing");
          document.removeEventListener("pointermove", move);
          document.removeEventListener("pointerup", up);
          // 两个宽度一次落盘：分开写会各自跑一遍 applyVisualSettings，
          // 先把 --cx-panel-w 清掉再写回来，中间白闪一下
          setCfgMany([
            ["railWidth", Math.round(parseFloat(getComputedStyle(rootEl).getPropertyValue("--cx-rail-w")) || RAIL_WIDTH)],
            // 面板没拖过时变量是空的 → 0，保持「自动 1:1」而不是钉一个像素值
            ["panelWidth", Math.round(parseFloat(getComputedStyle(rootEl).getPropertyValue("--cx-panel-w")) || 0)]
          ]);
        };
        document.addEventListener("pointermove", move);
        document.addEventListener("pointerup", up);
      });
    });
  }
```

Wait: there's a bug risk. `setCfgMany` → applyVisualSettings → applyPanelWidth(cfg("panelWidth")). If the user dragged the panel, panelWidth is a real number → sets the var. Good. If the user dragged only the rail and the panel was auto, panelWidth=0 → removeProperty → CSS falls back to 50% → the panel width changes from whatever computed during... it was never changed. Fine.

Edge case: user drags the *rail* handle. `move` only sets `--cx-rail-w`. Panel var unset → panelWidth stays 0 → auto 50%. Good, matches previous behavior (previously restoreColumnWidths would restore only stored keys; drag persisted both keys: `persistWidth(PANEL_W_KEY, parseFloat(...) || 500)` → for the panel var unset, `parseFloat("")||500` = 500 → it persisted 500, which on next load would set a 500px panel! That's the OLD buggy behavior: dragging the rail alone would freeze the panel at 500px on reload. My change actually fixes that. Note: old behavior, when dragging the rail, persisted PANEL_W_KEY=500 even though the user never touched the panel. So my version is better. But it's a behavior change — for the better; I'll mention it.

Hmm, actually careful: legacy migration reads panelWidth from the old key. If an existing user has `linuxdo-codex-panel-w` = "500" (from that bug), migration sets panelWidth=500. That's faithful to what they currently see. Fine.

